      "writtenOn": "2022-06-17T22:22:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "if its already specified that user space should wait 5 secs ( fwupd in this case) \nwhy would fwupd try with out wait ,then collect -ebusy and retry again after 5 secs ?\n\nI doubt if fwupd has port specific info so that it can keep track of per port requests\n\n1) if user space waits 5 secs there is no issue.\n2) if not this CL should be able to handle for safe recovery,",
